---
const faqs = [
  [
    'Is NZAP Engine free?',
    'Yes. The app is free, and Colab’s free tier includes GPU time (usually a T4). If you subscribe to Colab Pro, NZAP uses your compute units and the faster GPUs that come with them, and shows how fast they burn.',
  ],
  [
    'Does anything run on my computer?',
    'Only the app window. Models, packages and files live on your Colab runtime, so a laptop without a GPU works fine.',
  ],
  [
    'Is my Google account safe?',
    'NZAP Engine signs in with OAuth and PKCE in your own browser. The refresh token is stored in your operating system’s keychain and never reaches the interface. There is no NZAP server and no NZAP account, and the app sends no telemetry.',
  ],
  [
    'Who can publish apps, and are they reviewed?',
    'Anyone can open a pull request to the public collection. Every notebook is reviewed, downloads are checked against a SHA-256 in the catalog, and code that apps import must be pinned so reviewers see exactly what runs.',
  ],
  [
    'Is this an official Google product?',
    'No. NZAP Engine is made by NZAP Labs and uses the same endpoints as Google’s own Colab CLI and VS Code extension. Use it within the Colab terms of service.',
  ],
  [
    'How do updates work?',
    'The app checks for signed updates and installs them in a few seconds from Settings → Updates. Runtimes keep running on Colab in the meantime.',
  ],
]
---

<section class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-5 pb-28 md:px-8 md:pb-36">
  <h2 class="reveal chrome-text text-center text-4xl font-medium tracking-[-0.03em] md:text-5xl">
    Questions
  </h2>
  <div class="mt-12 divide-y divide-white/5 border-y border-white/5">
    {faqs.map(([question, answer]) => (
      <details class="reveal group py-5">
        <summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-6 text-lg font-medium">
          {question}
          <span class="text-2xl leading-none text-graphite transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">
            +
          </span>
        </summary>
        <p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed text-graphite">{answer}</p>
      </details>
    ))}
  </div>
</section>
